# Added 08-Aug-2026 - PyInstaller output for desktop_app.py (see
# TURION_Desktop.spec, the reproducible build recipe, which IS
# tracked) - build/ is intermediate analysis output, dist/ is the
# ~100MB .exe itself, neither belongs in git history. Build locally
# with: pyinstaller TURION_Desktop.spec
build/
dist/
reports/*.xlsx
reports/*.json
